%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as Pager
  participant J as t.db-journal
  participant D as t.db
  P->>J: cold 0x00 hdr
  P->>J: orig pages
  Note over P,D: syncJournal (EXCLUSIVE)
  alt synchronous=FULL
    P->>J: fsync + dir
    P->>J: 0xd9 + nRec
    P->>J: fsync jnl
  else synchronous=NORMAL
    P->>J: 0xd9 + nRec
    P->>J: fsync + dir
  end
  Note over J: journal is hot
  P->>D: sorted dirty pages
  P->>D: fsync t.db
  Note over P,D: commit point (pager_end_transaction)
  P->>J: del/trunc/0
  Note over P,D: post-commit only if file shrank
  P->>D: ftruncate t.db
